      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Actual files stay at user-selected paths.\nManaged clone mirrors the GitHub layout.\nContent files contain original bytes only.\nGitHub holds published version history.\nOffline edits and conflicts use local Git refs.\nNo separate snapshot archive is required.\nSee the exact local layout below.",
      "originalText": "Actual files stay at user-selected paths.\nManaged clone mirrors the GitHub layout.\nContent files contain original bytes only.\nGitHub holds published version history.\nOffline edits and conflicts use local Git refs.\nNo separate snapshot archive is required.\nSee the exact local layout below.",
