      "text": "Local files: authoritative input for edits.\nShared branch: accepted cross-device state.\nGitHub: published contents and history.\nLocal: paths, revisions, work and conflicts.\nResolve locally; publish the accepted result.\nRecheck both sides before resuming sync.",
      "originalText": "Local files: authoritative input for edits.\nShared branch: accepted cross-device state.\nGitHub: published contents and history.\nLocal: paths, revisions, work and conflicts.\nResolve locally; publish the accepted result.\nRecheck both sides before resuming sync.",
