      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792041037674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use root-relative ignore patterns.\nExclude Abode storage and nested Git\nmetadata. Exclusion stops management; it does\nnot delete actual files.\nRecord empty directories in metadata.\nDefine symlink policy before supporting it.",
      "originalText": "Use root-relative ignore patterns.\nExclude Abode storage and nested Git\nmetadata. Exclusion stops management; it does\nnot delete actual files.\nRecord empty directories in metadata.\nDefine symlink policy before supporting it.",
