      "updated": 1792041037674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Later: per-device variants and encryption.\nLater: stable child IDs for rename tracking.\nInitially, child rename = delete + add.\nValidate path containment and case collisions\nbefore every cross-platform application.",
      "originalText": "Later: per-device variants and encryption.\nLater: stable child IDs for rename tracking.\nInitially, child rename = delete + add.\nValidate path containment and case collisions\nbefore every cross-platform application.",
