      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792047934855,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "repo/\n  .git/                     \n  # local Git internals\n  roots/\n    nvim--a81f39c2/\n      metadata.json\n      content/\n        init.lua\n        lua/\n          plugins.lua\n        scripts/\n          setup.sh\n    kitty.conf--c92d170b/\n      metadata.json\n      content/\n        kitty.conf\n\nThe tracked layout is identical on GitHub.\n.git/ is local; config.toml lives outside repo/.\nEach root has its own namespace.\ncontent/ contains original bytes recursively.\nNo metadata headers inside content files.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "repo/\n  .git/                     \n  # local Git internals\n  roots/\n    nvim--a81f39c2/\n      metadata.json\n      content/\n        init.lua\n        lua/\n          plugins.lua\n        scripts/\n          setup.sh\n    kitty.conf--c92d170b/\n      metadata.json\n      content/\n        kitty.conf\n\nThe tracked layout is identical on GitHub.\n.git/ is local; config.toml lives outside repo/.\nEach root has its own namespace.\ncontent/ contains original bytes recursively.\nNo metadata headers inside content files.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
